# Safety net for any build that uses the repository root as its context without a Dockerfile of its
# own ignore file. The images in infra/compose each have a <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to them,
# and that file takes precedence for them.
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
web/dist
site/dist
site/.astro
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
